|desc=
Improves your damage with shield-based skills, and increases your Spell Save by {{CTS|3|10|0.75}} and Physical Save by {{CTS|5|20|0.75}}.

The way that this talent increases your damage is by adding half of this talent's level to the level of many talents that specifically attack with a shield, when using combatTalentWeaponDamage (cTWD), for the purpose of all shield damage calculations. e.g. {{t|Shield Pummel}} at level 1 with level 4 Shield Expertise does equal damage to Shield Pummel at level 3 without Shield Expertise.

Affects the following talents:
* {{c|Shield Offense}} talents: {{t|Shield Pummel}}, {{t|Shield Slam}}, {{t|Assault}}
* {{c|Shield Defense}} talents: {{t|Repulsion}}
* {{c|Guardian}} talents: {{t|Shield of Light}}, {{t|Brandish}}, {{t|Crusade}}
* {{ct|Technique}}/{{c|Other}} talents: {{t|Overpower}}
* {{c|Demonic Pact}} talents: {{t|Demon Seed}}
* {{c|Doom Shield}} talents: {{t|Demonic Madness}}
* {{c|Infernal Combat}} talents: {{t|Demon Horns}}

Does not affect every talent that attacks with a shield. Talents not listed here are unaffected.
}}